      "evidence": [
        {
          "page": 2,
          "section": "Materials and methods",
          "quote": "The powders obtained by mechanical alloying were spheroidized in a thermal plasma flow using a Tek-15 unit manufactured by Tekna Plasma Systems Inc. (Canada). Tek-Sphero 15 plasma spheroidization unit is equipped with a high-frequency generator with a maximum power of 15 kW. Argon–hydrogen mixture was used as a plasma gas. The plant power (10–15 kW), reactor pressure (10–15 psia), powder feed rate, and powder injection point into the plasma flow are the main parameters to be varied.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null,
